    <string name="tuto_1_title">Welcome to Stats MKWorld!</string>
    <string name="tuto_1_text">You\'re about to enter the wonderful world of competitive statistics for the new game Mario Kart World.\n\nThis app is a tool to track the progression of a player and their team through stats gathered from match entries. These stats are detailed across various aspects (players, opponents, tracks, scores…) and provide averages, records, and progression indicators.</string>
    <string name="next">Next</string>
    <string name="tuto_1_second_text">Before getting started, there are some prerequisites:\n\n- The project is linked to the MKCentral platform; you must be registered as a player on the site.\n\n- You must also have a Discord account linked to your MKCentral profile.\n\nIf either of these conditions isn\'t met, you won\'t be able to register on the app.</string>
    <string name="tuto_2_title">Allow link opening</string>
    <string name="tuto_2_text">First, the app needs a few permissions, starting with allowing dedicated links to open. This is necessary to authenticate via Discord.\n\nThis permission is required on devices running Android 12 and above.</string>
    <string name="tuto_2_button">Link settings</string>
    <string name="tuto_2_second_text">Once in the settings, simply select \"Add link\" and add the proposed link \"statsmkworld.com\" to allow it to open within the app.</string>
    <string name="tuto_3_title">Allow notifications</string>
    <string name="tuto_3_text">The app also needs to send you notifications to keep you informed about certain processes.\n\nThis permission is required on devices running Android 13 and above.</string>
    <string name="activer">Enable</string>
    <string name="tuto_3_second_text">Don\'t worry, the app will never spam you under any circumstances.</string>
    <string name="tuto_4_title">Login via Discord</string>
    <string name="tuto_4_text">Perfect! It\'s time to authenticate using your Discord account.</string>
    <string name="tuto_5_title">Fetching your profile</string>
    <string name="tuto_5_text">To provide you with the best possible experience, the app will retrieve your MKCentral data. Please wait while your profile is being fetched.</string>
    <string name="tuto_6_title">Everything is ready!</string>
    <string name="tuto_6_text">You can now enjoy all the features the app has to offer. Good luck on the MKWorld tracks!</string>
    <string name="tuto_7_title">Oops!</string>
    <string name="tuto_7_message">An error occurred while retrieving your MKCentral profile. There are three main reasons:\n\n- Your Discord account isn\'t linked to MKCentral.\n- The MKCentral server isn\'t responding.\n- Poor network connection.</string>
    <string name="retry">Retry</string>
    <string name="tuto_7_second_text">Note: You must be registered on MKCentral to use the app.</string>
